    <h1 data-lang="es">¿Qué es Salesforce Marketing Cloud? Guía Completa de Marketing Cloud Engagement</h1>
    <h1 data-lang="en">What is Salesforce Marketing Cloud? Complete Marketing Cloud Engagement Guide</h1>

    <div class="article-meta">
      <span class="article-meta-item">📅 <span data-lang="es">Actualizado</span><span data-lang="en">Updated</span>: Sep 2026</span>
      <span class="article-meta-item">⏱️ 12 min read</span>
